{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_otter_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_otter_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "滿滿的日程表",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_otter_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "4ebab26a99c493547486383c6aacea1f871d5e91ae3d33d6c034843da6589afe",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "个人剧情 梅尔"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "羅德島本艦\n“魯特拉工作室”"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "哦，時間差不多了嘛，該開始幹活了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "讓我看看今天的日程表。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "嗯，還行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "答應麥麥的“龍騰無人機操作改進方案”今天截稿，一會收個尾，然後等她來就行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "塞雷婭的防護服檢修委託？主要是刷新塗料吧......糟了，我是不是沒訂塗料？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "啊——還好還好，上次的沒用完。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "今天主要就做這個。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "如果還有空閒，就發幾份新零件的訂單出去，然後給服役的咪波們好好維護一下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "嗯，今天就做這些。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "開工啦！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "梅爾！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "梅爾快開門啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "有急事！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "塞雷婭這件衣服不太對勁啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "充能率怎麼都上不去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "奇怪，到底是哪裡出問題了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "梅爾，我知道你在裡面！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "我都聽見你聲音了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "是這裡嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "啊哈~果然。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "找到癥結問題就好處理了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "是你逼我的啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "只要修復失效節點，整件衣服應該就能重新工作了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "嗯哼，先優化充能路線，然後上塗料，馬上就能恢復到正常運作狀態。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "要不要再順帶加點額外功能呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "//（开门的音效）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "唉，不知道亂用權限會不會被凱爾希罵......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "不管了，要怪就怪梅爾裝聾。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "梅爾！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "搞定。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "節點位置再檢查一遍吧，一會上塗料滲進去就麻煩了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "幹活戴耳機，就不怕被人嚇到嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "哼哼——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "（拍梅爾肩膀）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "（張嘴咬人）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "嗚啊啊啊啊！！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "好疼好疼！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "鬆口，快鬆口啊！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "我不好吃啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "好過分喔梅爾，難得有好事情找你，不幫我開門就算了，還咬我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "抱歉啦可露希爾，你又不是不知道我工作的時候被打擾會咬人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "text": "嗚嗚嗚嗚。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "那我也給你咬一下，好不好？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "text": "你現在是不是在給衣服上抗源石塗料？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "是啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "text": "那還是算了，現在咬你一口，下一秒就得進醫療部，不划算。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "啊，好像是這樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "可露希爾？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "text": "怎麼了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "門怎麼關不上了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "我記得特地設置過自動開關，剛剛還調成請勿打擾來著。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "是不是你把門禁給駭了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "text": "啊——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "text": "怎麼會~~我就這樣走進來的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "text": "是你門沒鎖啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "我沒鎖嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "......奇怪。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "你等一下，我看看監控錄影。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "text": "！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "text": "梅爾你裝監控的嗎？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "我這裡很多東西都是萊茵內部資料啊，萬一丟了什麼東西對大家都不好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "基本保險措施還是需要的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "text": "現在還是先工作吧......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "text": "注意，注意安全操作規程啊。這個塗料，挺危險的吧，你這樣三心二意，會出事的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "沒事，我用機械臂呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "嗯，是哪個程式來著？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "text": "額，梅爾，塗料的性質是不是要變化了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "你是說這個？還好啦，這是惰性塗料。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "就算浸水燒開電離三小時再凍住，只要一解凍，馬上就能用。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "是這個資料夾嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "ok，監控程序打開。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "text": "！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "把時間拖到——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "text": "梅爾！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "text": "不和我一起做智慧型機器人嗎！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "text": "梅爾？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "text": "梅，梅爾？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "你剛剛說什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "再，再說一遍？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "text": "和我一起做智慧型機器人好不好？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "好啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "text": "那詳情我們——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "（按下開關播放監控影片）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "滋——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "監控影片",
      "text": "（開門的音效）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "監控影片",
      "text": "唉，不知道亂用權限會不會被凱爾希罵......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "監控影片",
      "text": "不管了，要怪就怪梅爾裝聾。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "咪波。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "咬她。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "咪波",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "text": "啊啊啊我錯了別用咪波啊好疼好疼哇啊啊！！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "說吧，大概需要我做什麼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "text": "嗚嗚嗚嗚......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "text": "我想要你幫我搞一下爆炸方面的東西......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "text": "基座機器是雷神挑釁者熔岩貓魔鬼高性能版作業平台......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "text": "上面已經有一個定制的全量熱力法術衝擊發生器了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "text": "但那個效果不太理想，所以需要你幫幫忙......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "text": "嗚嗚嗚嗚......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "哦好吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "你先聞一下這個。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "text": "好的嗚嗚嗚......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "text": "（吸氣）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "text": "！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "text": "這是！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "text": "（深吸一口氣）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "好了沒有？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "text": "哈啊~~~~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "text": "好了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "text": "欸嘿嘿嘿，謝謝梅爾。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "你再這樣哭下去沒法談生意啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "text": "也是也是，嘿嘿。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "也不知道你為什麼那麼喜歡聞我這裡的精煉潤滑油......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "text": "那當然是因為好聞啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "看來華法琳說的沒錯，你血管裡沒有血，只有機油。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "不說了，談正事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "text": "好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "是需要我給雷神挑釁者做改裝，提高攻擊能力對吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "text": "還有自我防衛、受擊抗性和戰場脫離方案的設計，畢竟是要植入智慧的好傢伙，可不能用一次就壞了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "那你是找對人了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "那麼，報酬呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "text": "你記不記得機庫那裡有一間小儲物間啊，只要你——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "這份差事我接了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "text": "嘿嘿，合作愉快。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "愉快愉快~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "但是呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "text": "啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "你看到那邊的黑板了嗎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "text": "貼滿紙的那塊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "那是我的排期表。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "就算加急，你的需求也在最後一張紙的右下角。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "text": "啊——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "text": "能再插個隊嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "不行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "text": "也就是說，兩個月之後。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "快的話五十天。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "text": "你工作速度那麼快的嗎？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "還好吧，有時候靈感一來工作就做完了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "text": "呃......那我不打擾你了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "text": "加油工作哦！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "等等！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "你先幫我把門格式化，我要重新調整。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "還有，把你的最高權限去掉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "現在、立刻、馬上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "text": "啊——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "text": "好......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "兩小時後"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "還有最後一小塊——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "叮咚"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "梅爾，是我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "唔......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "你換密碼了嗎，門怎麼開不了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "這下應該差不多了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "啊？門口有誰在嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "是我！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "麥麥！門壞了！按門旁按鈕進來吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "你好呀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "好啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "我這邊還在忙塞雷婭的東西，就不招待你了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "那麼，找我有事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "我可是有預約的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "無人機方案，做得怎麼樣啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "啊......哦！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "那個，已經做完了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "列舉了一點技術要點、改進方案和材料需求，全都在桌上的那個文件袋裡了，你先看看，沒有問題就可以約新時間幫你做些配件了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "要是有問題的話我們找個時間聊聊細節。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "好呀，謝謝梅爾。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "那是哪張桌子的哪個文件袋呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "那個那個。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "你機械臂指的位置至少有四張桌子，我怎麼知道是哪個嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "梅爾——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "啊別拉，我還在弄塗料！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "塗料過一會也可以塗的，先幫我找找文件袋好不好？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "梅爾~~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "我知道啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "嗯，謝謝~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "嗯——是這個。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "哦......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "這個是你上個月的報銷清單哦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "啊抱歉，其實是這個。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "對了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "謝謝你梅爾！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "沒什麼啦，應該的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "那我先走了，拜拜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "最重要的事差點忘記了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "我問你，現在幾點了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "中午吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "是下午！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "梅爾，你吃飯了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "啊？我嘛？我吃根能量棒就好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "那怎麼行！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "給，拿著！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "這是？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "食堂買的，今天有你喜歡吃的河鮮。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "本來想請你一起吃的，結果我自己也把時間忙忘了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "所以吃完以後打包了一份過來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "唔唔，謝謝。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "一定要吃啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "嗯，我會的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "還有什麼事嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "這是塞雷婭的充能護服？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "是啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "你大概還要做多久？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "一兩個小時吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "那可不行，我幫你一起弄。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "沒事，我可以的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "要嘛讓我幫你一起弄，要嘛我餵你吃飯，選吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "呃......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "好了我知道了拜託你了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "嘻嘻~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "那我們就開工吧~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "呼，完工。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "辛苦啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "過來洗手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "好——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "哈......也就只有這個時候，才會懷念萊茵的全自動清潔設備。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "那為什麼不回去呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "回去了就要被安排一大堆麻煩的工作，都沒時間改進咪波。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "而且，在那邊還要處理人際關係。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "這裡也需要啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "你出外勤比較多，對部門間的爭鬥不熟悉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "在那裡啊，今天認識個新朋友，回頭就會有人和你說：“這個人是某某部門的關係，你離他遠點比較好。”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "更可怕的是，就算同一個部門，有時候也要因為上司間的競爭關係爾虞我詐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "我是真的不擅長應付這些事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "所以就溜到這裡來了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "是這樣啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "對不起，我不該問這些的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "沒事......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "好，吃飯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "那我也該離開了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "咪波，麻煩你監督她一下，不然我一走她又要直接開始幹活了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "咪波沒裝語音模組，不會回應你的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "那也得叮囑一下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "那麼，這次是真的要走了，拜拜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "拜拜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "嗯，要不先訂好零件再吃——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "嗚哇，咪波你要幹什麼！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "咪波",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "只是先幹一會活，不會忘記吃飯的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "咪波",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "呃......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "好我知道了，我吃，現在就吃！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "呼，飽了。好，幹活！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "嗯，先訂材料還是先修咪波？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "咪波",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "還是先咪波好了，咪波比較重要。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "過來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "咪波",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "我看看——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "補漆、檢查佈線、資料更新、補充能源。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "維護一隻大概需要做這些......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "好了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "出任務的還有4隻，備用的5隻也要維護。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "現在幾點來著？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "看來今天能搞定。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "應該能搞定。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "只要別再有人——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "梅爾！開門！！有事找你！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "——————",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "怎麼又~！@~#！@",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "呼，呼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "冷靜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "吸氣——呼氣，吸氣——呼氣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "微笑~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "呦，你在啊梅爾。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "遇上什麼好事了笑那麼開心？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "你過來，我告訴你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "好啊——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "你看，這是咪波。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "我知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "把手伸過來，有好東西給你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "唉，真是稀奇，是什麼好東西？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "咪波，咬他。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "咪波",
      "text": "——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "啊啊啊別咬我疼疼疼疼疼！！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "深夜"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "啊——終於。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "完成了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "今天早上的計畫全部完成！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "咪波",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "啊——那個不算，我剛剛決定把訂零件的工作移到明天了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "咪波",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "讓我來看看明天要做些什麼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "去採購部訂些零件。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "要給醫療部安裝實驗裝置。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "哦，工作台也要重新調試一下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "明天就做這些吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "現在是......11點36分。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "嗯，是該休息了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "吃碗泡麵就睡覺。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "明天見，咪波。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "咪波",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "啊好疼！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
